## Problem 5 — Multiple Decorator Execution Order

```python
def decorator1(function):
    def wrapper():
        print("Before 1")
        function()
        print("After 1")
    return wrapper


def decorator2(function):
    def wrapper():
        print("Before 2")
        function()
        print("After 2")
    return wrapper


@decorator1
@decorator2
def learn():
    print("Python Learning")


learn()
```

### Output

```text
Before 1
Before 2
Python Learning
After 2
After 1
```

